message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Auditing Demographic Variation in LLM Relationship Advice"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Authors"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipelines for auditing demographic variation in
  large language model advice responses, combining dictionary-based keyword
  analysis with Fisher's exact tests and LLM ordinal annotation with
  Mann-Whitney U tests.
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - fairness
  - bias audit
  - large language models
